    {
      "key": "communityEditProfileIntro",
      "english": "Share as much or as little as you like. Nothing here is visible until you save it.",
      "st": "Arolelana ho hongata kapa ho honyenyane kamoo o ratang. Ha ho letho mona le bonahalang ho fihlela o le boloka.",
      "ts": "Avelana swo tala kumbe switsongo hi laha u lavaka. A ku na lexi vonakaka laha ku fikela loko u xi hlayisa.",
      "ve": "Kovhanani zwinzhi kana zwiṱuku nga hune na funa. A hu na tshithu tshi vhonalaho afha u swika ni tshi tshi vhulunga."
